(できれば、スカートたくしあげの参考画像のように、縄で吊るされて立たされているような感じでお願いしたいです)\n\n以前pixivで描かれていたので不要かもしれませんが、\nコンウェイの資料です\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1PyxggzneyXhwKRsFZeE6SMC0qcn97DSM/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/14jFEGdJrAG7ahnFbUIAXyHD-2UYL5s7h/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1oF9arSjXW7Bl43k4I6w-kv-dKJ1DCgbA/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n変態チックな内容ですみません。\n不満な点があれば、断っても構いませんので、\nどうかよろしくお願いします", "nc": 168, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_mairu_/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 83773, "client_id": 2663295, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2468eacd/uploads/origins/92ce39ea-8608-4b2d-90bb-93c620b81aaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1795e3c9140b0363876fbe921b4061c0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2468eacd/uploads/origins/92ce39ea-8608-4b2d-90bb-93c620b81aaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1795e3c9140b0363876fbe921b4061c0, https://si.imgix.net/2468eacd/uploads/origins/92ce39ea-8608-4b2d-90bb-93c620b81aaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef173fbf575b5e2801148af0dde45055 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2468eacd/uploads/origins/92ce39ea-8608-4b2d-90bb-93c620b81aaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=048eb900d79a1b9a4a8478dc9c3c9eaa 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2468eacd/uploads/origins/92ce39ea-8608-4b2d-90bb-93c620b81aaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=975ba85b0247c6c658f9c747991f1f1b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2468eacd/uploads/origins/92ce39ea-8608-4b2d-90bb-93c620b81aaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=975ba85b0247c6c658f9c